  "name": "Sweet and Sour Chicken",
  "subtitle": "Tangy pineapple chicken with crisp vegetables",
  "description": "Cooked chicken combines with pineapple, peppers, celery, and water chestnuts in a thick sweet-and-sour sauce.",
